        <details class="fold reveal" id="sla">
          <summary><span>Reply times</span> How fast we respond on each plan</summary>
          <div class="fold__body">
            <div class="table-wrap">
              <table class="spec spec--sla">
                <caption>Reply times</caption>
                <thead><tr><th scope="col"></th><th scope="col">Operate</th><th scope="col">Optimise</th><th scope="col">Partner</th></tr></thead>
                <tbody>
                  <tr><th scope="row">Critical: down, or wrong results at scale</th><td>Next business day</td><td>Same business day</td><td>4 business hours</td></tr>
                  <tr><th scope="row">High: a part failing, with a workaround</th><td>2 business days</td><td>Next business day</td><td>Same business day</td></tr>
                  <tr><th scope="row">Normal: questions and requests</th><td>3 business days</td><td>2 business days</td><td>Next business day</td></tr>
                  <tr><th scope="row">Monitoring &amp; alerts</th><td>✓</td><td>✓</td><td>✓</td></tr>
                  <tr><th scope="row">Security updates &amp; maintenance</th><td>✓</td><td>✓</td><td>✓</td></tr>
                  <tr><th scope="row">Accuracy check</th><td>Quarterly</td><td>Monthly</td><td>Monthly</td></tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
            <p class="small muted">Business hours are Monday to Friday, 08:00–17:00 SAST, excluding public holidays. Response time is a person acknowledging the issue with a first assessment, not a guaranteed fix time. We monitor the AI providers we use but can&rsquo;t guarantee their uptime; we guarantee how fast we respond and that your system falls back safely.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>

